window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Welcome back to Serenity, where the wolf shifters hide in plain sight. This bundle contains One True Mate series books 9 and 10, and also the series book Valentines Day Treasure, and the companion book, Let's Talk One True Mate.</p> <p>One True Mate 9: Troy was a man trapped in a wolf’s body for three decades, until a nap changed his life forever. Now that he’s a wolf trapped in a man’s body, he’s not going back. Food? Good. Partying? Better. Women? Best. With one brother missing, one brother overwhelmed by parenting twin engels, and only distracted Mac to keep him straight, Troy is fulfilling his every desire, never sleeping, rarely working, refusing to reel it in. Until he sees her.</p> <p>One True Mate 10: Trent Burbank is a wolf shifter who has never shifted into a man. He’s on a mission—send the beast home. He’s given his word that the beast will be coming home, and Trent always keeps his word. After a devastating trauma, his plans are interrupted. Trent is yanked away from the life he knows and charged with a critical task that only he can complete. Now his vow has changed. But when he discovers keeping his word could mean losing his mate, Trent prepares to fight....</p> <p>One True Mate Valentine's Day Treasure (unofficial 4.5): Divine gifts aren't meant to be refused. In Serenity, Illinois, even Valentine's Day can't escape the extraordinary. Four couples, bound by shared purpose and burgeoning love, find their sanctuary threatened by a catastrophic storm.</p> <p>Let's Talk One True Mate: This is a companion book and insider's guide to the series, containing character information, story details, and a whole lot of other fun and interesting tidbits. In it, I reveal what state 11 is in right now (working SO hard on it), and I include a generalized retelling of what's happened in the series so far (picture it, Serenity, 2016…), told by Timber and Canyon.</p> <p><b>PLEASE NOTE: When you purchase this title, the accompanying PDF will be available in your Audible Library along with the audio.</b></p>"; 
